google21domain","verdict":"verified","source":"openalex","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:07Z","response_hash":"b1dba319ed5a7684","fields":{"author":"Hwang, Dongseong and Misra, Ananya and Huo, Zhouyuan and Siddhartha, Nikhil and Garg, Shefali and Qiu, David and Sim, Khe Chai and Strohman, Trevor and Beaufays, Françoise and He, Yanzhang","booktitle":"NeurIPS","title":"Large-Scale ASR Domain Adaptation Using Self- and Semi-Supervised Learning","year":"2022","volume":"","number":"","pages":"6627-6631","doi":"10.1109/ICASSP43922.2022.9746719"},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"graves2006connectionist","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:07Z","response_hash":"","fields":{"title":"Connectionist temporal classification: labelling unsegmented sequence data with recurrent neural networks","author":"Graves, Alex and Fern{\\'a}ndez, Santiago and Gomez, Faustino and Schmidhuber, J{\\\"u}rgen","booktitle":"Proc. ICML","pages":"369--376","year":"2006"},"diffs":[],"failure_note":"not found at the registries — books published before DOIs often are not registered; the entry may still be correct"},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"gulati2020conformer","verdict":"verified","source":"crossref-query","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:07Z","response_hash":"3dbb9e61fdd6e6a7","fields":{"title":"Conformer: Convolution-augmented Transformer for Speech Recognition","author":"Anmol Gulati et al","journal":"Proc. Interspeech","pages":"5036--5040","year":"2020"},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"gururangan-etal-2020-dont","verdict":"verified","source":"openalex","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:07Z","response_hash":"b1dba319ed5a7684","fields":{"title":"Don{'}t Stop Pretraining: Adapt Language Models to Domains and Tasks","author":"Gururangan, Suchin  and\n      Marasovi{\\'c}, Ana  and\n      Swayamdipta, Swabha  and\n      Lo, Kyle  and\n      Beltagy, Iz  and\n      Downey, Doug  and\n      Smith, Noah A.","booktitle":"Proc. of the 58th Annu. Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics","month":"jul","year":"2020","address":"Online","publisher":"Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"https://aclanthology.org/2020.acl-main.740","doi":"10.18653/v1/2020.acl-main.740","pages":"8342--8360","abstract":"Language models pretrained on text from a wide variety of sources form the foundation of today{'}s NLP. In light of the success of these broad-coverage models, we investigate whether it is still helpful to tailor a pretrained model to the domain of a target task. We present a study across four domains (biomedical and computer science publications, news, and reviews) and eight classification tasks, showing that a second phase of pretraining in-domain (domain-adaptive pretraining) leads to performance gains, under both high- and low-resource settings. Moreover, adapting to the task{'}s unlabeled data (task-adaptive pretraining) improves performance even after domain-adaptive pretraining. Finally, we show that adapting to a task corpus augmented using simple data selection strategies is an effective alternative, especially when resources for domain-adaptive pretraining might be unavailable. Overall, we consistently find that multi-phase adaptive pretraining offers large gains in task performance."},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"hatzigeorgiu2000design","verdict":"verified","source":"crossref-query","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:07Z","response_hash":"2d588fdb1c0581e9","fields":{"title":"Design and Implementation of the Online ILSP Greek Corpus.","author":"Hatzigeorgiu, Nick and Gavrilidou, Maria and Piperidis, Stelios and Carayannis, George and Papakostopoulou, Anastasia and Spiliotopoulou, Athanassia and Vacalopoulou, Anna and Labropoulou, Penny and Mantzari, Elena and Papageorgiou, Harris and others","booktitle":"LREC","year":"2000"},"diffs":[]},{"kind":"bib-entry","target":"heafield2011kenlm","verdict":"unverified","source":"none","fetched_at":"2026-09-12T00:30:07Z","response_hash":"","fi